      "y": 282,
      "width": 212.0,
      "height": 252,
      "text": "Shorten:\n1. Client → Gateway → URL Svc\n2. Hash Generator → Base62\n3. Store in DB + warm cache\n\nRedirect:\n1. Client → Gateway → URL Svc\n2. Check Redis cache first\n3. DB lookup if miss → 301",
